(root/'README.md').write_text('''# Shadow System // Winter Arc — Monster Change 16\n\n## Proof-of-Work / Achievement Engine\n\nMutation 16 turns the system from a progress tracker into a persistent evidence archive for real-world transformation.\n\n### Major systems\n- Project Dossiers: concrete projects with intended outcomes and status\n- Evidence Receipts: attach verifiable outputs/links/notes to projects\n- Before → After Ledger: seal a written capability comparison\n- Capability Coverage audit: see which real capabilities have evidence\n- Archive Wall: visual memory layer\n- Portfolio Chamber: JSON archive, readable HTML dossier, integrity seals\n- Archive KPIs: proofs, projects, milestones, capability coverage, integrity\n- Persistent local storage and export compatibility\n- 12 dedicated proof/archive artworks\n\n### Design law\nThe app never treats a checkbox or fantasy combat action as proof of real-world competence. Real output, practice, evidence and reflection are the source material. The interface simply makes that transformation visible and portable.\n\nAndroid version: 3.0.0 / versionCode 12.\n''')
